# Freya Crescent {R}: "Jump - During your turn, Freya Crescent has flying. {T}: Add {R}. Spend this mana only to cast an Equipment spell or
# activate an equip ability." (CR 604.1, 106.6, 602.2b, 702.6a). Turn 1 Bot1 casts Freya with a Mountain. Turn 3 Freya flies (it is Bot1's
# turn); the Mountain pays for a Raging Goblin, which leaves Freya's {R} the only mana: it is restricted, so it can't pay the second Raging
# Goblin, but it pays Coral Sword ({R}, an Equipment spell), whose trigger attaches it to Freya. Turn 4 (Bot2's) Freya has no flying. Turn 5 it
# flies again, and Freya's {R} pays Coral Sword's equip {1}, moving it to the Raging Goblin: a 2/1.

